  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Akt&#xf6;rssamverkansprojekt mellan SEI och policy utvecklare i Vietnam samt f&#xf6;retagsorganisationen VINASME f&#xf6;r att utveckla metoder och f&#xe5; till st&#xe5;nd gr&#xf6;nare produktion inom sm&#xe5;- medelstora vietnamesiska f&#xf6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to establish a long term institutional partnership between ISPONRE, VINASME and SEI on Strengthening Vietnam SME&apos;s responsibility in climate change mitigation by promoting the green management and practices in their daily operational practices.</narrative>
